{
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "WiGO PRO \u2014 API mobile",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "description": "Contrat entre le back-office Laravel et l'application mobile **WiGO PRO**\n(chauffeurs Yango en C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, op\u00e9r\u00e9 par At Confort Plus).\n\n- Montants en **entiers FCFA** (XOF).\n- Dates au format **ISO 8601 UTC**.\n- Identifiants **ULID**.\n- Messages d'erreur **en fran\u00e7ais**, pr\u00eats \u00e0 afficher.\n- Enveloppe unique : succ\u00e8s `{ message, data }`, erreur\n  `{ message, errors }`. Le code HTTP porte le statut, jamais le corps.\n- Pagination **curseur** : `meta.next_cursor` et `links.next`,\n  `per_page` \u2264 50.\n- Authentification par **jeton Sanctum** (habilitation `mobile:*`) obtenu\n  via `POST /auth/otp/verify`."
    },
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1"
        }
    ],
    "security": [
        {
            "http": []
        }
    ],
    "paths": {
        "/announcements": {
            "get": {
                "operationId": "v1.announcements.index",
                "description": "Uniquement celles publi\u00e9es : actives et, si elles ont une fen\u00eatre de\ndiffusion, dans cette fen\u00eatre. Tri\u00e9es par ordre d'affichage.\n\nPagination par curseur : `meta.next_cursor` porte le curseur suivant\n(`null` sur la derni\u00e8re page), \u00e0 renvoyer dans `?cursor=`. `per_page`\nest plafonn\u00e9 \u00e0 50.",
                "summary": "Lister les banni\u00e8res de l'accueil",
                "tags": [
                    "Announcement"
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "description": "Message pr\u00eat \u00e0 afficher, en fran\u00e7ais."
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "array",
                                            "items": {
                                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AnnouncementResource"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "meta": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "description": "Pagination par curseur : `per_page`, `next_cursor` (`null` sur la derni\u00e8re page)."
                                        },
                                        "links": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "description": "Liens de pagination (`next`, `prev`) lorsqu'ils existent."
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "message",
                                        "data"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/AuthenticationException"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/auth/otp/request": {
            "post": {
                "operationId": "v1.auth.otp.request",
                "description": "Envoie un code \u00e0 6 chiffres (valable 5 minutes) par SMS ou WhatsApp. Le\nconducteur doit \u00eatre pr\u00e9-enregistr\u00e9 par le back-office : l'application\nmobile ne cr\u00e9e pas de compte.\n\nLimit\u00e9 \u00e0 3 envois par tranche de 10 minutes et par num\u00e9ro.\n\nEn d\u00e9veloppement et en test (`WIGO_OTP_EXPOSE_CODE`), la r\u00e9ponse contient\nen plus le champ `code` : il est toujours absent en production.",
                "summary": "Demander un code OTP",
                "tags": [
                    "Auth"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OtpRequestRequest"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "properties": {
                                                "channel": {
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "enum": [
                                                        "sms",
                                                        "whatsapp"
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                "expires_at": {
                                                    "type": "string"
                                                },
                                                "code": {
                                                    "type": "string"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "required": [
                                                "channel",
                                                "expires_at"
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "message",
                                        "data"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationException"
                    }
                },
                "security": []
            }
        },
        "/auth/otp/verify": {
            "post": {
                "operationId": "v1.auth.otp.verify",
                "description": "D\u00e9livre un jeton Sanctum portant l'habilitation `mobile:*`, \u00e0 placer dans\nl'en-t\u00eate `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Plusieurs codes peuvent \u00eatre\nvalides simultan\u00e9ment ; une v\u00e9rification r\u00e9ussie les consomme tous.\n\nApr\u00e8s 5 saisies erron\u00e9es, le num\u00e9ro est verrouill\u00e9 15 minutes.",
                "summary": "V\u00e9rifier l'OTP et obtenir un jeton",
                "tags": [
                    "Auth"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OtpVerifyRequest"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "properties": {
                                                "token": {
                                                    "type": "string"
                                                },
                                                "driver": {
                                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DriverResource"
                                                },
                                                "terms": {
                                                    "type": "object",
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "current_version": {
                                                            "type": "string"
                                                        },
                                                        "accepted": {
                                                            "type": "boolean"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "required": [
                                                        "current_version",
                                                        "accepted"
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "required": [
                                                "token",
                                                "driver",
                                                "terms"
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "message",
                                        "data"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationException"
                    }
                },
                "security": []
            }
        },
        "/auth/logout": {
            "post": {
                "operationId": "v1.auth.logout",
                "description": "R\u00e9voque uniquement le jeton pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 ; les autres appareils du conducteur\nrestent connect\u00e9s.",
                "summary": "Se d\u00e9connecter",
                "tags": [
                    "Auth"
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "additionalProperties": {
                                                "type": "object"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "message",
                                        "data"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/AuthenticationException"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/me": {
            "get": {
                "operationId": "v1.me",
                "description": "Accessible m\u00eame lorsque le compte est suspendu, afin que l'application\npuisse afficher le motif et permettre la d\u00e9connexion.",
                "summary": "Profil du conducteur",
                "tags": [
                    "Auth"
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "description": "Message pr\u00eat \u00e0 afficher, en fran\u00e7ais."
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DriverResource"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "message",
                                        "data"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/AuthenticationException"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/me/push-token": {
            "put": {
                "operationId": "v1.me.push-token",
                "description": "Requis pour recevoir les notifications push (messages data-only).",
                "summary": "Enregistrer le jeton FCM de l'appareil",
                "tags": [
                    "Auth"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdatePushTokenRequest"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "additionalProperties": {
                                                "type": "object"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "message",
                                        "data"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/AuthenticationException"
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationException"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/me/challenges": {
            "get": {
                "operationId": "v1.me.challenges",
                "description": "Un \u00e9l\u00e9ment par challenge ouvert, avec la progression propre au\nconducteur : tickets d\u00e9tenus et courses restantes avant le prochain pour\nune tombola, rang et prime pour un classement, gain \u00e9ventuel. Les blocs\n`ticketing`, `leaderboard` et `won` ne sont pr\u00e9sents que lorsqu'ils\ns'appliquent au challenge.\n\n`meta.weekly_history` porte les douze derni\u00e8res semaines de courses\ntermin\u00e9es, de la plus ancienne \u00e0 la semaine en cours.\n\nReste accessible \u00e0 un conducteur suspendu, comme le profil : ses\ncompteurs cessent simplement de progresser.",
                "summary": "Challenges en cours du conducteur",
                "tags": [
                    "MeChallenge"
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "array",
                                            "items": {
                                                "type": "object",
                                                "properties": {
                                                    "id": {
                                                        "type": "string"
                                                    },
                                                    "reference": {
                                                        "type": "string"
                                                    },
                                                    "name": {
                                                        "type": "string"
                                                    },
                                                    "type": {
                                                        "type": "string",
                                                        "enum": [
                                                            "leaderboard",
                                                            "raffle",
                                                            "surprise"
                                                        ]
                                                    },
                                                    "status": {
                                                        "type": "string",
                                                        "enum": [
                                                            "active",
                                                            "draw_pending",
                                                            "payout_pending"
                                                        ]
                                                    },
                                                    "criteria_summary": {
                                                        "type": "string"
                                                    },
                                                    "period": {
                                                        "type": "object",
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "start": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "end": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "week_iso": {
                                                                "type": [
                                                                    "string",
                                                                    "null"
                                                                ]
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "required": [
                                                            "start",
                                                            "end",
                                                            "week_iso"
                                                        ]
                                                    },
                                                    "prize": {
                                                        "type": [
                                                            "object",
                                                            "null"
                                                        ],
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "name": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "photo_url": {
                                                                "type": [
                                                                    "string",
                                                                    "null"
                                                                ]
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "required": [
                                                            "name",
                                                            "photo_url"
                                                        ]
                                                    },
                                                    "ticketing": {
                                                        "type": "object",
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "trips_per_ticket": {
                                                                "type": "integer"
                                                            },
                                                            "orders_completed": {
                                                                "type": "integer"
                                                            },
                                                            "tickets_held": {
                                                                "type": "integer"
                                                            },
                                                            "progress_in_block": {
                                                                "type": "integer"
                                                            },
                                                            "orders_to_next_ticket": {
                                                                "type": "integer"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "required": [
                                                            "trips_per_ticket",
                                                            "orders_completed",
                                                            "tickets_held",
                                                            "progress_in_block",
                                                            "orders_to_next_ticket"
                                                        ]
                                                    },
                                                    "leaderboard": {
                                                        "type": "object",
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "rank": {
                                                                "type": [
                                                                    "integer",
                                                                    "null"
                                                                ]
                                                            },
                                                            "winning_places": {
                                                                "type": "integer"
                                                            },
                                                            "reward_amount": {
                                                                "type": [
                                                                    "integer",
                                                                    "null"
                                                                ]
                                                            },
                                                            "in_winning_range": {
                                                                "type": "boolean"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "required": [
                                                            "rank",
                                                            "winning_places",
                                                            "reward_amount",
                                                            "in_winning_range"
                                                        ]
                                                    },
                                                    "won": {
                                                        "type": "object",
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "drawn_at": {
                                                                "type": [
                                                                    "string",
                                                                    "null"
                                                                ]
                                                            },
                                                            "prize_name": {
                                                                "type": [
                                                                    "string",
                                                                    "null"
                                                                ]
                                                            },
                                                            "amount": {
                                                                "type": [
                                                                    "integer",
                                                                    "null"
                                                                ]
                                                            },
                                                            "credited": {
                                                                "type": "boolean"
                                                            },
                                                            "collection_note": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "required": [
                                                            "drawn_at",
                                                            "prize_name",
                                                            "amount",
                                                            "credited"
                                                        ]
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "required": [
                                                    "id",
                                                    "reference",
                                                    "name",
                                                    "type",
                                                    "status",
                                                    "criteria_summary",
                                                    "period",
                                                    "prize"
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "meta": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "properties": {
                                                "weekly_history": {
                                                    "type": "array",
                                                    "items": {
                                                        "type": "object",
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "week_iso": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "label": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "orders_completed": {
                                                                "type": "integer"
                                                            },
                                                            "current": {
                                                                "type": "boolean"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "required": [
                                                            "week_iso",
                                                            "label",
                                                            "orders_completed",
                                                            "current"
                                                        ]
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "required": [
                                                "weekly_history"
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "message",
                                        "data",
                                        "meta"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/AuthenticationException"
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "components": {
        "securitySchemes": {
            "http": {
                "type": "http",
                "scheme": "bearer"
            }
        },
        "schemas": {
            "AnnouncementResource": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "id": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "title": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "media_type": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "image",
                            "video"
                        ]
                    },
                    "media_url": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "order": {
                        "type": "integer"
                    }
                },
                "required": [
                    "id",
                    "title",
                    "media_type",
                    "media_url",
                    "order"
                ],
                "title": "AnnouncementResource"
            },
            "DriverResource": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "id": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "first_name": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "last_name": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "phone": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Num\u00e9ro au format international.",
                        "examples": [
                            "+2250717738299"
                        ]
                    },
                    "license_no": {
                        "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                        ],
                        "description": "Num\u00e9ro de permis de conduire.",
                        "examples": [
                            "COMB012500370370A"
                        ]
                    },
                    "photo_url": {
                        "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                        ]
                    },
                    "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Un conducteur `suspended` conserve son jeton mais re\u00e7oit 403 sur\nles ressources m\u00e9tier.",
                        "enum": [
                            "active",
                            "suspended",
                            "dormant"
                        ]
                    },
                    "vehicle": {
                        "type": [
                            "object",
                            "null"
                        ],
                        "properties": {
                            "make": {
                                "type": [
                                    "string",
                                    "null"
                                ]
                            },
                            "model": {
                                "type": [
                                    "string",
                                    "null"
                                ]
                            },
                            "color": {
                                "type": [
                                    "string",
                                    "null"
                                ]
                            },
                            "plate": {
                                "type": "string"
                            }
                        },
                        "required": [
                            "make",
                            "model",
                            "color",
                            "plate"
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "required": [
                    "id",
                    "first_name",
                    "last_name",
                    "phone",
                    "license_no",
                    "photo_url",
                    "status"
                ],
                "title": "DriverResource"
            },
            "OtpChannel": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                    "whatsapp",
                    "sms"
                ],
                "title": "OtpChannel"
            },
            "OtpRequestRequest": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "phone": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "pattern": "^\\+[1-9]\\d{7,14}$"
                    },
                    "channel": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OtpChannel"
                    }
                },
                "required": [
                    "phone"
                ],
                "title": "OtpRequestRequest"
            },
            "OtpVerifyRequest": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "phone": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "pattern": "^\\+[1-9]\\d{7,14}$"
                    },
                    "code": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "device_name": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 120
                    },
                    "terms_version": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 20
                    }
                },
                "required": [
                    "phone",
                    "code",
                    "device_name"
                ],
                "title": "OtpVerifyRequest"
            },
            "UpdatePushTokenRequest": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "fcm_token": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 255
                    }
                },
                "required": [
                    "fcm_token"
                ],
                "title": "UpdatePushTokenRequest"
            }
        },
        "responses": {
            "ValidationException": {
                "description": "Validation error",
                "content": {
                    "application/json": {
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                                "message": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Errors overview."
                                },
                                "errors": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "description": "A detailed description of each field that failed validation.",
                                    "additionalProperties": {
                                        "type": "array",
                                        "items": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "required": [
                                "message",
                                "errors"
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "AuthenticationException": {
                "description": "Unauthenticated",
                "content": {
                    "application/json": {
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                                "message": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Error overview."
                                }
                            },
                            "required": [
                                "message"
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}